---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Dear Result Live (গোপনীয়তা নীতি)"
  description="Read the Privacy Policy of Dear Result Live. We respect user privacy, collect zero personal lottery transaction data, and ensure compliant analytics."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-8 text-slate-300">
    
    <div class="border-b border-slate-800 pb-6">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest">Legal Information</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white mt-1">
        Privacy Policy (গোপনীয়তা নীতি)
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-2">
        Last updated: October 2026. How Dear Result Live handles data and privacy.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">1. Information We Do Not Collect</h2>
        <p>
          Dear Result Live (<strong>dearresultlive.in</strong>) does not require user accounts, user logins, credit card information, bank details, or lottery ticket payment data. We do not sell lottery tickets or process any financial transactions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">2. Ticket Search Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          When you use our Instant Ticket Checker tool, your ticket number query is matched against public winning number lists. We do not store, profile, or link ticket numbers to personal identities.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">3. Web Push Notifications (OneSignal)</h2>
        <p>
          If you opt in to receive draw notifications, a non-personal anonymous device token is generated via OneSignal to deliver draw alerts at 1:00 PM, 6:00 PM, and 8:00 PM. You can disable notifications at any time in your browser settings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">4. Cookies & Web Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We use minimal, privacy-friendly technical cookies to preserve UI preferences (such as dismissed alert banners). Aggregated, anonymized performance metrics may be collected to monitor site uptime.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
